# ============================================================
#  ⚠ HOY ESTE ARCHIVO ES INERTE
#  felipevergel.com se sirve desde GitHub Pages, que NO permite
#  cabeceras propias. Queda escrito y listo para el dia que el
#  dominio pase a Netlify / Cloudflare Pages: ahi si se aplica
#  y cierra HSTS, clickjacking y MIME-sniffing de verdad.
#
#  Mientras tanto, lo unico que protege al sitio es la CSP que
#  viaja como <meta http-equiv> en los 4 HTML. Esa via NO admite
#  frame-ancestors ni report-uri: por eso X-Frame-Options y HSTS
#  siguen SIN cubrir hasta que se migre el hosting.
# ============================================================

/*
  Strict-Transport-Security: max-age=63072000; includeSubDomains; preload
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
  X-Frame-Options: DENY
  Referrer-Policy: strict-origin-when-cross-origin
  Permissions-Policy: camera=(), microphone=(), geolocation=(), payment=(), usb=()
  Cross-Origin-Opener-Policy: same-origin-allow-popups
  Content-Security-Policy: default-src 'self'; base-uri 'self'; object-src 'none'; frame-ancestors 'none'; script-src 'self' 'unsafe-inline' https://www.googletagmanager.com https://cdn.jsdelivr.net https://accounts.google.com https://apis.google.com https://script.google.com https://script.googleusercontent.com; script-src-elem 'self' 'unsafe-inline' https://www.googletagmanager.com https://cdn.jsdelivr.net https://accounts.google.com https://apis.google.com https://script.google.com https://script.googleusercontent.com; style-src 'self' 'unsafe-inline' https://fonts.googleapis.com https://accounts.google.com; style-src-elem 'self' 'unsafe-inline' https://fonts.googleapis.com https://accounts.google.com; font-src 'self' https://fonts.gstatic.com data:; img-src 'self' data: blob: https://*.googleusercontent.com https://www.googletagmanager.com https://www.google-analytics.com https://*.google-analytics.com https://accounts.google.com; connect-src 'self' https://fonts.googleapis.com https://fonts.gstatic.com https://api.emailjs.com https://script.google.com https://script.googleusercontent.com https://docs.google.com https://www.googleapis.com https://accounts.google.com https://production.wompi.co https://exquisite-pasca-848b8b.netlify.app https://www.googletagmanager.com https://www.google-analytics.com https://*.google-analytics.com https://*.analytics.google.com; frame-src https://accounts.google.com https://checkout.wompi.co; form-action 'self' https://docs.google.com https://checkout.wompi.co; manifest-src 'self'; worker-src 'self' blob:

# Nada de backend servido como estatico (defensa en profundidad: ademas
# estos archivos ya no viven dentro del sitio, ver _backend-no-publicar/).
/*.gs
  X-Robots-Tag: noindex
  Content-Type: text/plain

# Configuración de caché para Netlify
# HTML y JS: siempre frescos (sin caché) para que los cambios se vean al instante
/*.html
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=0, must-revalidate
/products.js
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=0, must-revalidate

# Imágenes y fuentes: caché largo (no cambian, para que el sitio cargue rápido)
/img/*
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=604800
/fonts/*
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=2592000
